  Drawn on the adaptive grid — a 108dp canvas whose outer 18dp on every side is fair game for the
  launcher to crop, so the glyph is scaled into the central 72dp and keeps its silhouette under
  every mask. The arrows are deliberately chunky: at 48dp in a launcher the strokes are what remain
  legible, and a hairline sync glyph turns into a smudge.
-->
